[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4249969994","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118571#issuecomment-4249969994","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118571","id":4249969994,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79UWVK","user":{"login":"warriormaster12","id":33091666,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMDkxNjY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33091666?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/warriormaster12","html_url":"https://github.com/warriormaster12","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warriormaster12/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warriormaster12/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warriormaster12/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warriormaster12/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warriormaster12/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warriormaster12/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warriormaster12/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warriormaster12/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warriormaster12/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-15T07:05:46Z","updated_at":"2026-04-15T07:05:46Z","body":"Should it work like this when having a really specific query? I at least would expect the results to be just first two items.\r\n<img width=\"289\" height=\"1415\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f729ecdf-a894-433a-b58d-882cc0cc58c6\" /> \r\n\r\nThere also seems to be a bug with search when popup menu has sub-menus. Tested with menu bar by hard-coding search_bar's visibility to true.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4249969994/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4250533018","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118571#issuecomment-4250533018","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118571","id":4250533018,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79Wfya","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-15T08:42:37Z","updated_at":"2026-04-15T08:42:37Z","body":"> Should it work like this when having a really specific query? I at least would expect the results to be just first two items.\r\n\r\nAs far as being consistent with the editor's use of `FuzzySearch`, yes. `FuzzySearch` defaults its `allow_subsequences` to `true` and `max_misses` to `2`, which is why you see things like `mixamorigRightArm` show up, as it matches on `mixamorig[...]h[...]A[...]` and forgives the lack of `e` and `d`.\r\n\r\nIt probably makes sense to expose `FuzzySearch::allow_subsequences` and `FuzzySearch::max_misses` as properties in `PopupMenu`, for people who want to tweak this, similar to how we have the `filesystem/quick_open_dialog/enable_fuzzy_matching` and `filesystem/quick_open_dialog/max_fuzzy_misses` editor settings.\r\n\r\nAlso, as mentioned above, there is no sorting based on the fuzzy scoring right now, so even exact matches won't bubble to the top, which is borderline buggy behavior, but once that's added (which I'll take on if nobody else does) the fuzzy matching might feel more intuitive.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4250533018/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5641174252","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118571#issuecomment-5641174252","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118571","id":5641174252,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUD187A","user":{"login":"michaelgundlach","id":5141333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNDEzMzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5141333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach","html_url":"https://github.com/michaelgundlach","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-11T22:06:40Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T22:06:40Z","body":"In 4.6.3 and earlier, clicking `Sprite2D.texture` in the Inspector, then pressing `Q <enter>` would open Quick Load.  This was broken in 4.7, since `EditorResourcePicker` doesn't pre-select the first matching result when you press `Q`.\r\n\r\nI believe `#7 [PopupMenu] ⚠️ Changed so that the first item is pre-selected when search filtering` addresses this regression, right?  Doesn't seem controversial to me :)\r\n\r\nPerhaps if people don't want every `PopupMenu` to pre-select, you could at least enable pre-selection for `EditorResourcePicker` so the original behavior is restored?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5641174252/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5663214279","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118571#issuecomment-5663214279","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118571","id":5663214279,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUY3Kxw","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-14T11:28:26Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T11:28:26Z","body":"> I believe `#7 [PopupMenu] ⚠️ Changed so that the first item is pre-selected when search filtering` addresses this regression, right? Doesn't seem controversial to me :)\r\n\r\nI haven't checked by which mechanism this worked prior to 4.7, but I tried extracting that part out as part of #119312, and ran into some tough questions with regards to accessibility. I can't remember the exact details off the top of my head, but it seemed like you wouldn't want this kind of pre-selection behavior when using a screen reader. It could maybe be conditionally done based on whether `AccessibilityServer` is active or not, or something like that.\r\n\r\nAnyway, any remaining work here (whatever still makes sense) is unfortunately low priority for me right now, so somebody else would have to do it. I'd suggest you create a new issue for this UX regression, if it is indeed a regression.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5663214279/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5697156746","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118571#issuecomment-5697156746","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118571","id":5697156746,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABU5O2ig","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-16T12:07:50Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T12:07:50Z","body":"It seems there was a pending PR for selecting the first visible item already: #119613","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5697156746/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]